Encoding: UTF-8
Description: Searches for parsimonious regression models, builds correlation
    tables, and plots fitted interactions for data frames and multiply imputed
    data. Supports linear and generalized linear model search, custom fitting
    and scoring functions, and response-scale predictions from selected models.
